WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.546 --> 00:00:01.920
SPEAKER: Have you
ever considered

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.070
how your choice of database
could ease development and help

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.280
accelerate your time to market?

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.810
Google Cloud Spanner,
the horizontally-scalable

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.840
relational database,
provides all the familiarity

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.379
of relational databases such
as transactions across rows,

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:19.860
enforce data types, schema,
and complex queries,

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:24.450
meaning no time lost learning
new languages or paradigms.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.240
And, unlike traditional
relational databases,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.770
Cloud Spanner grows with
the needs of your app

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.740
so you can have confidence
in the knowledge

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.270
that you'll never have
to re-platform for scale.

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:37.380
Cloud Spanner not only allows
you to deploy your application

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.890
faster, it also delivers
a better user experience

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:44.970
by improving data consistency,
eliminating inconsistent reads,

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:48.390
and helping to reduce
time-consuming bugs.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.450
Google Cloud Spanner-- fast
track your application's path

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.150
to success.

